<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia PSC says finalising acquisition.</title>
<headline>Malaysia PSC says finalising acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian shipbuilder PSC Industries Bhd said the company was finalising the details of &quot;a substantial acquisition&quot;.</p>
<p>In a preliminary announcement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange, PSC said further details on the proposed acquisition and its request for requotation of its stock would be made in due course.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded on July 2 at 31.75 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
